arm sounds locally.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"sends a message to the night phone\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the alarm sends a message to the night phone.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Go to the freezer and read the display.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Under First response, the reference instructs going to the freezer and reading the display.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Write the reading and the time in the freezer log before touching anything else.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The reading at the moment of arrival is the one the lab needs\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"it cannot be recovered later\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the arrival reading cannot be recovered later.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Close the door and wait 20 minutes.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Under the door-ajar heading, the reference gives this instruction.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"If the temperature falls back below the set point, log it as a door event\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"no further action is needed\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states no further action is needed in that case.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Call the on-call technician if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after you arrive\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference instructs calling the technician when the temperature keeps rising, with a timing condition that entails the claim's general instruction.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-012\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"While waiting, do not open the door\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states not to open the door while waiting.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-013\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"opening a door on a failing freezer to check the contents is the most common cause of loss in this building\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-014\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Contents are moved only on the technician's instruction\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-015\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"only into a freezer that already has space at the same set point\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"A-016\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Never split a single study's samples across two freezers.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-001\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The alarm panel names the unit and shows the temperature that triggered it.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the panel names the unit.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-002\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The alarm panel names the unit and shows the temperature that triggered it.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states the panel shows the triggering temperature.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-003\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"there are three units on this floor\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-004\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"two of them alarm at the same set point\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states two of the three units alarm at the same set point.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-005\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"ice on the seal holds the door open by a few millimetres\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-006\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"is the usual cause of a slow rise\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states ice on the seal is the usual cause of a slow rise.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-007\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Call the on-call technician if the temperature is still rising 20 minutes after you arrive\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this directly.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-008\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"give the unit name, the reading you took on arrival and the reading now\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference lists the same three items to give the technician.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-009\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Every alarm gets a line in the freezer log whether or not anything was wrong.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this verbatim.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-010\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"An alarm with no line in the log is indistinguishable from an alarm nobody attended.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this with the same meaning.\"},{\"claim_id\":\"B-011\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The night phone is carried by the weekend duty officer from 18:00 on Friday until 08:00 on Monday.\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The reference states this verbatim.\"}]}","ttft_ms":16464,"type":"result","duration_ms":16502,"uuid":"6a